<title>USA: Bankers Trust Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.99		    $1.72</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.98		     1.71</p>
